{"seq":4,"slug":"statistics","title":"统计学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics","introMarkdown":"# 统计学 简介\n\n统计学提供从数据中提取信息、量化不确定性并据此做出决策的系统方法。在数据爆炸的时代，统计思维已经成为自然科学、社会科学、工程技术乃至商业管理领域的通用语言。学好统计，核心并非记忆公式，而是培养\"用数据说话\"的严谨直觉。\n\n本知识体系从数据的描述与可视化开始，逐步深入到推断与建模，最终到达概率论的数学根基和统计方法的实际应用，为自学者建立完整的统计学能力栈。\n\n第一章**描述统计**介绍数据类型与分布形态的识别、集中趋势与离散程度的度量指标，以及用图表有效传达数据故事的可视化方法，这些是一切统计分析的起点。\n\n第二章**推断统计**在有限样本的基础上对总体参数做出判断，涵盖假设检验的逻辑框架、置信区间的构造方法以及回归分析的建模思路，让自学者具备从数据中得出可靠结论的能力。\n\n第三章**概率论**为推断统计提供数学根基，从概率公理与条件概率出发，讨论随机变量的分布特征和大数定律、中心极限定理等极限理论，帮助理解统计方法\"为什么有效\"。\n\n第四章**应用统计**将方法论落地到实验设计、抽样调查和多元分析等具体场景，展示统计工具在科研、市场调研和公共政策评估中的实战用法。\n\n建议自学者先完成描述统计获得数据感觉，再学习推断统计掌握核心工具，之后可根据兴趣在概率论的理论深度或应用统计的实战广度之间选择重点。动手分析真实数据集是最有效的学习方式。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"descriptive-statistics","title":"描述统计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/descriptive-statistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-types-distributions","title":"数据类型与分布","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/descriptive-statistics/data-types-distributions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"measures-of-central-tendency","title":"集中趋势度量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/descriptive-statistics/measures-of-central-tendency"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-visualization-methods","title":"数据可视化方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/descriptive-statistics/data-visualization-methods"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"inferential-statistics","title":"推断统计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/inferential-statistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hypothesis-testing","title":"假设检验","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/inferential-statistics/hypothesis-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"confidence-intervals","title":"置信区间","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/inferential-statistics/confidence-intervals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"regression-analysis-stats","title":"回归分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/inferential-statistics/regression-analysis-stats"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"probability-theory","title":"概率论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/probability-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"probability-foundations","title":"概率论基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/probability-theory/probability-foundations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"random-variables","title":"随机变量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/probability-theory/random-variables"},{"seq":3,"slug":"limit-theorems","title":"极限定理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/probability-theory/limit-theorems"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applied-statistics","title":"应用统计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/applied-statistics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experimental-design","title":"实验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/applied-statistics/experimental-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"survey-sampling","title":"调查抽样","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/applied-statistics/survey-sampling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multivariate-analysis","title":"多元分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/economics/statistics/applied-statistics/multivariate-analysis"}]}]}